  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n186.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="47" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/1" n="1"/>To the Master of the Choir: A psalm from the Sons of Korah. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/2" n="2"/>All the peoples clap hands, they call unto God with the sound of rejoicing <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/3" n="3"/>for the Lord is supreme, awe-inspiring, a great King over all the earth. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/4" n="4"/>He subdues peoples beneath us and nations under our feet. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/5" n="5"/>He will select our inheritance for us, the pride of Jacob whom He has loved, Selah. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/6" n="6"/>God arises amidst blasts, the Lord at the sound of the <tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n187.jpg" n="83"/>Shofar. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/7" n="7"/>Sing praise to God, sing to Him, sing to our King, sing praise to Him. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/8" n="8"/>For the King of all the earth is God, sing with intelligent understanding. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/9" n="9"/>God reigned over peoples, God is seated on His holy throne. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/47/10" n="10"/>The nobles of the peoples are assembled, the people of the God of Abraham; for the shields of the earth are of God, most exalted is He. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
